---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="About · Barış Gürbüzler" description="Co-founder & CEO of Hardal. Barcelona." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="animate-in">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

      <div class="about-text" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <p>
          I'm Barış. Originally from Antalya, studied in Istanbul, now living in Barcelona with my wife Göz, our cat Kiwi, and our dog Miso.
        </p>
        <p>
          I co-founded <a href="https://usehardal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hardal</a> with <a href="https://berkay.fyi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Berkay</a> because marketing analytics had become a mess, and weirdly hard for the marketers who relied on it most. We're fixing that: the best way for accurate data.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of building Hardal, I'm a curious generalist trying to go deeper. Things I keep coming back to: sailing, surfing, tennis, plants, and the sea in general. Barcelona makes most of these accessible.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is the website where I share what I'm learning. I'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <p class="contact-line">
          Find me on <a href="https://x.com/baris_v2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/barisgurbuzler/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
